  {
   "turn": 7,
   "response_text": "The key insight is that the validation accuracy is around 0.901-0.904, which is significantly higher than the healthy range of 0.8519\u20130.8607. Let me also check the data configuration more carefully:",
   "tool_calls": [
    {
     "id": "toolu_01CW2FFUvtisv2NFRteXFrNT",
